**MAINTENANCE OF THE WORK**

The Work has the status "author-maintained" if the copyright holder explicitly and prominently states near the primary copyright notice in the Work that the Work can only be maintained by the author.

The Work has the status "maintained" if there is a Current Maintainer who has stated in the Work that they accept the responsibility of maintaining the Work.

The Work has the status "unmaintained" if there is no Current Maintainer.

